{
	"$schema": "https://github.com/ConductionNL/nextcloud-vue/raw/main/src/schemas/app-manifest-v2.schema.json",
	"_note": "The configurable types, given a place to be configured. configurable-types-domain-model declared MeetingType, AgendaItemType, PositionType and GovernanceBodyComposition, and questions-as-agenda-items made AgendaItemType load-bearing: an oral question is now an agenda item whose TYPE says what kind it is. None of the four had a page. So the configuration this programme keeps creating could only arrive from a seeded example set, and an operator could never add a kind, rename one, or change a submission window. Configuration nobody can edit is not much better than the code it replaced. These live in the settings foldout, not the primary menu: ADR-004 caps the primary at six, and DecisionTemplates is already there for the same reason.",
	"_spec": "openspec/changes/configuration-surface/specs/configuration-surface/spec.md",
	"menu": [
